<title>USA: J.P. Morgan Securities wins $47 mln Albuquerque, N.M.. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan Securities wins $47 mln Albuquerque, N.M.. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Title corrected to show that J.P. Morgan won the bonds, not Smith Barney)</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities (corrects from Smith Barney) said it won $46.7 million of Albuquerque, N.M., joint water and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.774 percent.</p>
</text>
